WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.410
A clearer chart starts with one useful
level.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.310
Choose your market and timeframe.

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:09.410
Read the candles first, then add only the

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:10.370
context you need.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.110
Select the horizontal line tool in the
drawing

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.670
toolbar, and click the chart to place a

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:18.310
level. Return to Cursor when you finish
drawing.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:21.570
Use the level to describe structure, not
to

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:24.230
predict a guaranteed move.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.490
Change timeframe and check the surrounding
context.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:30.570
Now mark one level in the paper workspace,

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.650
and write why you chose it.

